# Never commit key material, dumps, or firmware images to this public repo
*.der
*.pem
*.key
*.bin
*.mem
*.rmf
*.z
*.su
*.tar
redone.[0-9]
sundance*.bin
iofpga*.bin
*_privkey*
*key*.txt
fw_dump/
fw_crypto/
fs_mirror/
dumps/

# --- Published artifacts (explicit exceptions to the broad rules above) ---
# These keys are intentionally public: they are DECRYPTION keys embedded in the
# camera firmware, not signing keys. See docs/keys.md.
!tools/fw-crypto/fw_v2_privkey.der
!tools/fw-crypto/fw_v3_privkey.der
# The log XOR pad is a published obfuscation constant, not a secret. See docs/log-decode.md.
!tools/red-log-decoder/log_xor_table.bin
# Same pad, embedded into dsmc-core via include_bytes! for `dsmcdbg log decode`.
!tools/dsmc-core/src/log_xor_table.bin
